    "turn_text": "if you don't mind. Well, it just so happened that I actually was in the White House, scheduled already to be in the White House on the day that the coal memorandum was overturned. I think it was either that day or maybe it was the next day, but it was that day. So it was that exact day. Went from the barbershop",
